        <div style="color:var(--accent-gold);font-weight:600;font-size:.85rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:2px;margin-bottom:8px">OUR STORY</div>
        <h2 style="color:var(--primary);margin-bottom:20px">The Story Behind DHS Multispecialty Hospital</h2>
        <p style="font-size:1rem;line-height:1.8;color:var(--text-light);margin-bottom:15px">The idea of DHS Multispecialty Hospital began way back in the seventies when its founder Shri Mitesh Shah saw his father — a doctor — going out of the way to help people in his humble clinic in a small town.</p>
        <p style="font-size:1rem;line-height:1.8;color:var(--text-light);margin-bottom:15px">He envisioned a place which would offer the best-in-class facilities to all people while ensuring care and comfort. He wanted to build a health haven where patient needs take primary importance over corporate interest.</p>
        <p style="font-size:1rem;line-height:1.8;color:var(--text-light)">He spent a decade researching hospital design and architecture, visiting the finest healthcare facilities worldwide, and bringing that knowledge to life in Ahmedabad. The result is DHS Multispecialty Hospital — where care meets comfort.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <img src="/assets/images/about/dhs-about.jpg" alt="DHS Multispecialty Hospital building in Ahmedabad" style="border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow)" loading="lazy" width="600" height="400">
        <blockquote style="border-left:4px solid var(--primary);padding:20px 24px;margin:25px 0 0;background:#fff;border-radius:0 var(--radius) var(--radius) 0;box-shadow:var(--shadow)">
          <p style="font-style:italic;color:var(--text-light);margin-bottom:10px;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.7">"My father was always ready to help everyone in distress. He treated everyone equally — rich or poor. He is my inspiration to build a hospital that puts patients first."</p>
          <strong style="color:var(--primary)">— Shri Miteshbhai Shah, Founder</strong>
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

